{"id":"mtk-b5-ukur","title":"Satuan, Keliling, Luas, dan Waktu","subject":"matematika","fase":["B"],"kelas":[3,4],"elemen":["Pengukuran"],"packId":"mtk-b5","summary":"Satuan panjang dan berat, keliling sebagai pagar, luas sebagai banyak persegi satuan, serta menghitung lama waktu.","objectives":["mengubah satuan panjang dan berat","menghitung keliling bangun datar","menghitung luas dengan persegi satuan","membedakan keliling dan luas","menghitung lama waktu suatu kegiatan"],"sections":[{"id":"satuan","title":"Satuan panjang dan berat","html":"\n      <div class=\"two\"><div class=\"rumus-box\"><span class=\"lbl\">Panjang</span>1 km = 1.000 m · 1 m = 100 cm · 1 cm = 10 mm</div><div class=\"rumus-box\"><span class=\"lbl\">Berat</span>1 kg = 1.000 g</div></div>\n      <p>Dari satuan besar ke kecil, kalikan. Dari satuan kecil ke besar, bagi. 2 kg = 2 × 1.000 = 2.000 g. 750 m × 2 × 5 = 7.500 m = 7,5 km.</p>"},{"id":"keliling-luas","title":"Keliling dan luas","html":"\n      <figure class=\"lesson-fig\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 290 180\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Persegi panjang 6 kali 4 satuan\"><rect x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#e8eafb\" stroke=\"#3d47c9\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"20\" y=\"50\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#e8eafb\" stroke=\"#3d47c9\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"20\" y=\"80\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#e8eafb\" stroke=\"#3d47c9\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"20\" y=\"110\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#e8eafb\" stroke=\"#3d47c9\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"50\" y=\"20\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#e8eafb\" stroke=\"#3d47c9\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"50\" y=\"50\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#e8eafb\" stroke=\"#3d47c9\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"50\" y=\"80\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#e8eafb\" stroke=\"#3d47c9\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"50\" y=\"110\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#e8eafb\" stroke=\"#3d47c9\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"80\" y=\"20\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#e8eafb\" stroke=\"#3d47c9\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"80\" y=\"50\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#e8eafb\" stroke=\"#3d47c9\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"80\" y=\"80\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#e8eafb\" stroke=\"#3d47c9\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"80\" y=\"110\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#e8eafb\" stroke=\"#3d47c9\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"110\" y=\"20\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#e8eafb\" stroke=\"#3d47c9\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"110\" y=\"50\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#e8eafb\" stroke=\"#3d47c9\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"110\" y=\"80\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#e8eafb\" stroke=\"#3d47c9\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"110\" y=\"110\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#e8eafb\" stroke=\"#3d47c9\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"140\" y=\"20\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#e8eafb\" stroke=\"#3d47c9\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"140\" y=\"50\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#e8eafb\" stroke=\"#3d47c9\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"140\" y=\"80\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#e8eafb\" stroke=\"#3d47c9\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"140\" y=\"110\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#e8eafb\" stroke=\"#3d47c9\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"170\" y=\"20\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#e8eafb\" stroke=\"#3d47c9\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"170\" y=\"50\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#e8eafb\" stroke=\"#3d47c9\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"170\" y=\"80\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#e8eafb\" stroke=\"#3d47c9\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"170\" y=\"110\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#e8eafb\" stroke=\"#3d47c9\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"180\" height=\"120\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1b1e2b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><text x=\"110\" y=\"160\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Figtree\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#1b1e2b\">6 satuan</text><text x=\"208\" y=\"84\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"Figtree\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#1b1e2b\">4 satuan</text></svg><figcaption>Luas = 6 × 4 = 24 persegi satuan, keliling = 2 × (6 + 4) = 20 satuan.</figcaption></figure>\n      <p><b>Keliling</b> adalah panjang garis di pinggir bangun, seperti pagar. <b>Luas</b> adalah banyak persegi satuan yang menutup bagian dalamnya, seperti ubin.</p>\n      <div class=\"two\"><div class=\"rumus-box\"><span class=\"lbl\">Persegi panjang</span>K = 2 × (p + l) · L = p × l</div><div class=\"rumus-box\"><span class=\"lbl\">Persegi</span>K = 4 × s · L = s × s</div></div>\n      <div class=\"ingat\">Keliling sama tidak berarti luas sama. Persegi panjang 5 × 1 dan persegi 3 × 3 sama-sama berkeliling 12, tetapi luasnya 5 dan 9.</div>"},{"id":"waktu","title":"Menghitung lama waktu","html":"\n      <p>1 jam = 60 menit. Untuk menghitung lama waktu, lompat ke jam bulat dulu.</p>\n      <div class=\"contoh\"><span class=\"lbl\">Contoh</span><p>Film mulai 09.40 dan selesai 11.10. Dari 09.40 ke 10.00 = 20 menit, dari 10.00 ke 11.00 = 1 jam, dari 11.00 ke 11.10 = 10 menit. Totalnya 1 jam 30 menit.</p></div>"}]}